Description: Omarchy desktop for Hyprland with Armbian branding
 The Omarchy desktop: Hyprland configuration in Lua, a Quickshell shell
 with bar, menus and panels, helper commands and themes. Armbian changes
 the branding and adapts Arch-specific parts to Debian.
